":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1670575?shelf=zz-09-reviewed"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"auth-blain-et-al","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1670575?shelf=auth-blain-et-al"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2667409201"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.u2L6EnEhnIteM87huwdSPA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.u2L6EnEhnIteM87huwdSPA","creator":{"__ref":"User:1670575"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1683421358447,"createdAt":1551661785074,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1683073769914,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eJessica and Pat, love their story\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI have to report that initially I was hesitant to read their story. I love these characters so much as secondary characters in the other stories that I was afraid that Susan/RJ would not be able to maintain their uniqueness and appeal for 90,000 plus words. Silly me, the story did NOT disappoint or let me down. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eYou don't need to read the other stories before reading this, chronologically this is the earliest in the series so far. In this book the United States are ending, the Royal States are beginning. Null and Void is next, about 20 years later. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe author again pokes at the caste system that has developed to quantify magical ability. The unethical and illogical practice of child marriage gets vilified as well. Light hearted moments abound as does a happy ever after. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ePrior to this author I didn't always enjoy romances written from the hero's point of view. She has written several both as Copperfield and Blain that have become rereads for me. So I had no hesitation reading and investing in this story that is written from Pat's point of view. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn summary highly recommend this book and series. The stories I've read by this author are all keepers. The author is an auto-order regardless of which name she is using. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNow I'm torn, do I reread this story or move on and do a full circuit with Null and Void then Captive King then Guiding Light and finally Huntress. Decisions. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ecross posted amazon, goodreads, book bub\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A204LA6DMFFUJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}"},"likeCount":6,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:50127420":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":50127420,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1469617142i/50127420._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":3,"textReviewsCount":231,"name":"Cryogenic Fire","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/50127420-cryogenic-fire","contributor":null,"id":50127420},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2SUIC41H87EHI":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2SUIC41H87EHI"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2SUIC41H87EHI\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2SUIC41H87EHI","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2SUIC41H87EHI"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/50127420?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2730522992"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.q5Y1sXjTOFEe6Og5lvsLRw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.q5Y1sXjTOFEe6Og5lvsLRw","creator":{"__ref":"User:50127420"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1554323405283,"createdAt":1551195868078,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1551196250389,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eHappy 🤗\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI've been hoping and waiting for this book since I finished \"Null and Void\" , and I'm over the moon it's finally here, and yes, it was worth the wait.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is Pat and Jessica's story. We have the fainting episode, chicken and yams, horses, more chicken and yams and a damn good story. Yes it's part of the 'Royal States' series (prequel really) but it can be read as a standalone.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHighly recommended.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2SUIC41H87EHI\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:69631016":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":69631016,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1695645840i/69631016._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":30,"textReviewsCount":4019,"name":"Natalie  H","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/69631016-natalie-h","contributor":null,"id":69631016},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17GDN3XCGUF39":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17GDN3XCGUF39"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A17GDN3XCGUF39\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A17GDN3XCGUF39","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A17GDN3XCGUF39"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS