User:kca://profile:goodreads/AJC2WML80OK0I","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AJC2WML80OK0I"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/12854357?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2866531589"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.h1x7x8iXN5KcuZcwGlIKPQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.h1x7x8iXN5KcuZcwGlIKPQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:12854357"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1592363620917,"createdAt":1564041174871,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1564044181883,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003e3.5 Goodreads; 4 Amazon: a likable Gary Stu, w/1st-person PoV and a lot of horse-rehab content in parts. \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLow-caste janitor/BBQ cook becomes a company's get-organized savior, society's most in-demand event chef, and a princess's chosen mate, while taking care of two special-needs horses — not terribly likely, but entertaining, often humorous, and amiable. The book's summary doesn't reflect more than half of that, so I hope it's not considered too spoiler-y, but I felt it necessary to make the point.\u003cbr /\u003eThis world has often been an odd mix: all about the inequities of magic-based castes [and gender], yet many of the royals and other upper echelon we actually meet are very human and approachable (and often impractical). The \"lecturiness\" doesn't get overwhelming.\u003cbr /\u003eAs someone who likes horses (and appreciates caring for animals in need), I enjoyed the filly Morning Glory and the dangerous-from-past-abuse black stallion's page time, but it may be more than other readers want. (I recall such complaints on one Patricia Briggs novel, no less!)\u003cbr /\u003eIt's kind of silly, imho, how Pat's always ordered to make the same meal, and even before that how much in benefits he's given right from the start at his new employment, but I like him, and Jessica is a firecracker (well, lightning bolt) of a princess.\u003cbr /\u003eThe storyline involves Pat's worry over how he can manage all his responsibilities and aspirations, but there's really only one early detective-type inquiry, and a late action sequence, followed by a denouement of family and politics. \u003cbr /\u003eOverall, if you've previously enjoyed RJ Blain/ Susan Copperfield, or other light urban fantasy with romance, there's no reason not to give this a try. Having read other books in the Royal States series is particularly NOT a prerequisite this time: this is a prequel, set when the North American governments are just re-forming.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AJC2WML80OK0I\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:2650335":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":2650335,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1319863717i/2650335._UX200_CR0,49,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":84,"textReviewsCount":1402,"name":"Sandra","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/2650335-sandra","contributor":null,"id":2650335},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1PPL19AX8RW4E":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1PPL19AX8RW4E"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1PPL19AX8RW4E\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1PPL19AX8RW4E","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1PPL19AX8RW4E"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2650335?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"kindle","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2650335?shelf=kindle"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"own","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2650335?shelf=own"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"pnr-uf","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2650335?shelf=pnr-uf"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"witch-magic-fae","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2650335?shelf=witch-magic-fae"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"r-j-blain","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/2650335?shelf=r-j-blain"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/2671300760"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.qyPrkbmVeYUi-fYnDZrybw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.qyPrkbmVeYUi-fYnDZrybw","creator":{"__ref":"User:2650335"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1752808581027,"createdAt":1571912928629,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1752808581026,"text":"We've met Queen Jessica \u0026amp; King Pat in Null \u0026amp; Void, so it was a pleasure to see them when they meet and how they start their lives together.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd how the infamous Chicken \u0026amp; Yams became such a staple food. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is another book from the male POV and RJ Blain/Susan Copperfield is brilliant at it.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJessica is the one with the magic talent, stormweaver, so she'll be protecting Texas and surrounding Kingdoms from the yearly hurricane assault, but Pat always thought he had a minor horse empath talent. As he's from the lower caste he works hard, studies hard and gives everything he has to getting ahead, even though he doesn't expect to get anywhere. He's intelligent and loves cooking, so he gets a scholarship to cooking school as he figures everyone has to eat.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eJust loved it all. This series has been an absolute find for me.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1PPL19AX8RW4E\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:1358111":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":1358111,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1405613079i/1358111._UX200_CR0,49,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":4,"textReviewsCount":1231,"name":"Nathan","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/1358111-nathan","contributor":null,"id":1358111},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3POHP0W9KFTEE":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3POHP0W9KFTEE"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.jr9ncuFqUlEhvdYC":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.jr9ncuFqUlEhvdYC"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3POHP0W9KFTEE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.jr9ncuFqUlEhvdYC\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3POHP0W9KFTEE","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3POHP0W9KFTEE"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.jr9ncuFqUlEhvdYC","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.jr9ncuFqUlEhvdYC"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1358111?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6432646458"},"Review:kca://review:go