racters are ordinary people (if somewhat obsessed by horses) who try to do the decent thing.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt should have been a wonderful world but it annoyed me: \u003cbr /\u003e1) sexism - the princess has been brought up politics and has the power to bring in storms, but she’s treated like an idiot girl whereas a man with only life experience is treated as knowledgeable \u003cbr /\u003e2) 2d - with the exception of the MMC none of the other characters have any personality\u003cbr /\u003e3) it’s really sssslllllllllllooooooooowwwwwww\u003cbr /\u003e4) the epilogue - not the most hope filling epilogue out there.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut hey, lots of other people have given it 4 or 5 star ratings, so what do I know?","rating":2,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A10ORGB1YD2H4P\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.7GzE5XVY2iFI9ut7\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:9276938":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":9276938,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1407766154i/9276938._UY200_CR13,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":31,"textReviewsCount":461,"name":"Paranormal Books R Us","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/9276938-paranormal-books-r-us","contributor":null,"id":9276938},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3L7R959IX5YZT":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3L7R959IX5YZT"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3L7R959IX5YZT\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3L7R959IX5YZT","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3L7R959IX5YZT"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf"