erella style, with lots of horses controlling the hordes. I wish we currently had the option to turn a protective, hostile, horse loose on governments to teach them the best way to treat people! Susan Copperfield has masterfully mixed the fun and romance with a strong heroine who has no trouble pointing out what is wrong with her country's social systems and her determination to fix them. Her hero is no pushover either! Throw in some great barbeque and horse rescues, and you'll be reading until 2am also!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1VFF9P29IXJOE\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:7357111":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":7357111,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1628171605i/7357111._UX200_CR0,20,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":14,"textReviewsCount":803,"name":"Kei","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/7357111-kei","contributor":null,"id":7357111},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ASCQLG6KIFO3I":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ASCQLG6KIFO3I"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ASCQLG6KIFO3I\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ASCQLG6KIFO3I","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ASCQLG6KIFO3I"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v1.ZrOFHbel79IK_xWyn3gS3Q"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/7357111?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"英語-english","webUrl":"https://w